#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:4
msgid "v3.6.5"
msgstr "v3.6.5"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:6
msgid ""
"v3.6.5 updates TensorFlow and :mod:`ulab`, substantially improves the "
"**HM01B0** camera (arbitrary resolutions, QQVGA, cropping, "
"``set_auto_exposure()``, and an anti-flicker fix), and brings Portenta "
"external-SDRAM and production board support. The legacy CMSIS-NN training "
"tooling/examples were removed and the OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer was reduced "
"— read the breaking changes below."
msgstr ""
"v3.6.5 ažurira TensorFlow i :mod:`ulab`\\ , znatno poboljšava kameru "
"**HM01B0** (proizvoljne razlučivosti, QQVGA, izrezivanje, "
"``set_auto_exposure()`` i ispravak protiv treperenja) te donosi podršku za "
"vanjski SDRAM Portente i produkcijske ploče. Naslijeđeni CMSIS-NN "
"alati/primjeri za treniranje su uklonjeni, a međuspremnik slike OpenMV 4 "
"Plus je smanjen — pročitajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost u "
"nastavku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:15
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:18
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Najvažnije"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:20
msgid ""
"**HM01B0** — arbitrary resolutions, QQVGA, cropping, and "
"``set_auto_exposure()`` support, plus an automatic-exposure flicker fix."
msgstr ""
"**HM01B0** — podrška za proizvoljne razlučivosti, QQVGA, izrezivanje i "
"``set_auto_exposure()`` te ispravak treperenja kod automatske ekspozicije."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:22
msgid "**TensorFlow / ulab** updated to their latest versions."
msgstr "**TensorFlow / ulab** ažurirani na svoje najnovije verzije."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:23
msgid "**Portenta** — external-SDRAM usage and production board files."
msgstr ""
"**Portenta** — korištenje vanjskog SDRAM-a i datoteke produkcijske ploče."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Fixes** — lens correction, image quality at low resolutions, and an FPS "
"clock fix."
msgstr ""
"**Ispravci** — korekcija leće, kvaliteta slike pri niskim razlučivostima i "
"ispravak FPS takta."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:26
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** the legacy CMSIS-NN training/conversion tooling and examples "
"were removed and the OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer was reduced — see the "
"breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Narušava kompatibilnost:** naslijeđeni CMSIS-NN alati za "
"treniranje/pretvorbu i primjeri su uklonjeni, a međuspremnik slike OpenMV 4 "
"Plus je smanjen — pogledajte promjene koje narušavaju kompatibilnost."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:31
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:33
msgid ""
"**HM01B0** — added arbitrary-resolution support, QQVGA and additional stubs,"
" sensor-side cropping, and :func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure` support."
msgstr ""
"**HM01B0** — dodana podrška za proizvoljne razlučivosti, QQVGA i dodatne "
"stubove, izrezivanje na strani senzora te podrška za "
":func:`sensor.set_auto_exposure`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:35
msgid ""
"**Apriltag readout** — added a readout-control apriltag-tracking example."
msgstr ""
"**Apriltag očitavanje** — dodan primjer praćenja apriltagova s kontrolom "
"očitavanja."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:38
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:40
msgid ""
"Updated TensorFlow and :mod:`ulab` to their latest versions; added Portenta "
"external-SDRAM usage and production/CI board files; cleaned up the MT9V034 "
"driver and the framebuffer accessor functions."
msgstr ""
"Ažurirani su TensorFlow i :mod:`ulab` na svoje najnovije verzije; dodano je "
"korištenje vanjskog SDRAM-a Portente i datoteke produkcijske/CI ploče; "
"očišćeni su MT9V034 upravljački program i accessor funkcije međuspremnika "
"slike."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:45
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:47
msgid "Camera and imaging:"
msgstr "Kamera i obrada slike:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:49
msgid ""
"Fixed flickering during automatic exposure on the HM01B0, lens correction, "
"image quality at lower resolutions, the OV5640/JPEG line copy (``dest_fb``),"
" the FPS clock, and returning 0 when ``bpp`` is negative; removed an "
"unnecessary HM01B0 horizontal flip."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno je treperenje tijekom automatske ekspozicije na HM01B0, "
"korekcija leće, kvaliteta slike pri nižim razlučivostima, OV5640/JPEG "
"kopiranje linija (\\ ``dest_fb``\\ ), FPS takt te vraćanje 0 kada je ``bpp``"
" negativan; uklonjeno je nepotrebno horizontalno zrcaljenje HM01B0."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:55
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Hardver i podrška za ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:57
msgid "**HM01B0** — arbitrary resolutions, QQVGA, and cropping."
msgstr "**HM01B0** — proizvoljne razlučivosti, QQVGA i izrezivanje."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:58
msgid ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — external SDRAM and updated production board files."
msgstr ""
"**Arduino Portenta H7** — vanjski SDRAM i ažurirane datoteke produkcijske "
"ploče."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:62
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:64
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v3.6.4 and v3.6.5. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/``, Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``, and the bundled"
" tooling/examples."
msgstr ""
"Promjene API-ja vidljive korisniku između v3.6.4 i v3.6.5. Opseg: Python "
"C-moduli u ``modules/``\\ , Python biblioteke u ``scripts/libraries/`` te "
"priloženi alati/primjeri."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:68
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Svaka je promjena označena svojim utjecajem:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:70
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — isti API, drugačiji rezultati; ponovno provjerite ugođene "
"skripte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:71
msgid ""
"*tooling* — affects the build/conversion tooling or bundled examples, not "
"the firmware Python API."
msgstr ""
"*tooling* — utječe na alate za build/pretvorbu ili priložene primjere, a ne "
"na Python API ugrađenog programa (firmware)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:74
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. If you just want to port your "
"code, jump to the :ref:`migration checklist <v3_6_5_migration>` at the end. "
"Each commit hash links to its diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Promjene su grupirane prema utjecaju tim redoslijedom. Ako samo želite "
"prenijeti svoj kôd, prijeđite na :ref:`kontrolni popis za migraciju "
"<v3_6_5_migration>` na kraju. Svaki hash commita vodi na svoj diff na "
"GitHubu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:81
msgid "OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer reduced *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Međuspremnik slike OpenMV 4 Plus smanjen *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:83
msgid ""
"The OpenMV 4 Plus framebuffer was reduced to 20 MB (and the OpenMV 2/3 "
"buffer size was corrected). Memory-tight scripts on the OpenMV 4 Plus that "
"allocated very large frames/objects from the framebuffer may now hit "
"allocation limits sooner and should be re-checked."
msgstr ""
"Međuspremnik slike OpenMV 4 Plus smanjen je na 20 MB (a veličina "
"međuspremnika OpenMV 2/3 je ispravljena). Memorijski tijesne skripte na "
"OpenMV 4 Plus koje su alocirale vrlo velike sličice/objekte iz međuspremnika"
" slike sada mogu ranije doseći granice alokacije i treba ih ponovno "
"provjeriti."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:88
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `3a790a827 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/3a790a827>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `3a790a827 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/3a790a827>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:93
msgid "Legacy CMSIS-NN tooling and examples removed *(tooling)*"
msgstr "Naslijeđeni CMSIS-NN alati i primjeri uklonjeni *(tooling)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:95
msgid ""
"The legacy CMSIS-NN model-training/conversion tooling (``nn_convert.py``, "
"``nn_quantizer.py``, the LeNet/CIFAR/smile model files) and the "
"``25-Machine-Learning/nn_*.py`` example scripts were removed. The ``nn`` "
"module itself still works in this release (it is removed later, in v3.9.0), "
"but the CMSIS-NN model-generation tooling is gone — use the TensorFlow Lite "
"(``tf``) workflow instead."
msgstr ""
"Naslijeđeni CMSIS-NN alati za treniranje/pretvorbu modela (\\ "
"``nn_convert.py``\\ , ``nn_quantizer.py``\\ , datoteke modela "
"LeNet/CIFAR/smile) i primjeri skripti ``25-Machine-Learning/nn_*.py`` su "
"uklonjeni. Sam modul ``nn`` još uvijek radi u ovom izdanju (uklonjen je "
"kasnije, u v3.9.0), ali alati za generiranje CMSIS-NN modela više ne postoje"
" — umjesto toga koristite TensorFlow Lite (\\ ``tf``\\ ) tijek rada."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:102
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `588f79a62 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/588f79a62>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `588f79a62 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/588f79a62>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:107
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolni popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v3.6.5.rst:109
msgid ""
"Re-check large framebuffer allocations on the OpenMV 4 Plus against the "
"reduced 20 MB framebuffer (:ref:`the framebuffer change <v3_6_5_fb>`), and "
"move CMSIS-NN model generation to the TensorFlow Lite workflow (:ref:`the "
"CMSIS-NN tooling removal <v3_6_5_cmsisnn>`). All other scripts run "
"unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Ponovno provjerite velike alokacije međuspremnika slike na OpenMV 4 Plus u "
"odnosu na smanjeni 20 MB međuspremnik slike (\\ :ref:`promjena međuspremnika"
" slike <v3_6_5_fb>`\\ ) i premjestite generiranje CMSIS-NN modela na "
"TensorFlow Lite tijek rada (\\ :ref:`uklanjanje CMSIS-NN alata "
"<v3_6_5_cmsisnn>`\\ ). Sve ostale skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
